	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Installation sur Ubuntu 16.04]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=25931#p25931"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>D&#039;après le README du projet, je suppose qu&#039;il s&#039;agit de :</p><div class="quotebox"><blockquote><div><p>6) The initial setup of the configuration database is interactive in server<br />&#160; &#160;mode,&#160; and non-interactive in desktop mode. You can run it either by<br />&#160; &#160;running:</p><p>&#160; &#160; (pgadmin4) $ python $PGADMIN4_SRC/web/setup.py</p><p>&#160; &#160;or by starting pgAdmin 4:</p><p>&#160; &#160; (pgadmin4) $ python $PGADMIN4_SRC/web/pgAdmin4.py</p></div></blockquote></div><p>Je n&#039;en connais pas beaucoup plus malheureusement.</p>]]></content>
		<author>
			<name><![CDATA[rjuju]]></name>
